    "description": {
      "en": "$tsceepi_rate6 (8.64%) is the complementary-pension (AGIRC-ARRCO) contribution rate for white-collar employees on the second income band (Income group B, between 1x and 4x the monthly PSS, bounded by $tsc_groupB_lim). It is used as a Band_Rate in tscee_fr/SchedCalc ('Complementary insurance for white collar'). The FR country report (Table 2.57) confirms 8.64% for the complementary pension on income group B."
